        "Content": "New To Market\r\nBy Private Treaty\r\nJenkinstown Park Co Kilkenny\r\nGuide Price €485,000\r\nPublic Viewing this Saturday 2pm to 2.30pm\r\nSale of detached single storey residence standing on Circa11acres. Situated beside Jenkinstown Park and Church.\r\nResidence, which was constructed in 2024, Ber Rating B. 702 sq ft.,\r\nEntrance porch leading to open plan living/dining/ kitchen area, hallway leading to one en-suite bedroom, main bathroom.  PVC double glazed windows and doors.  Air to water heating system. Garden area, back yard with old stone out offices. Three span round roof shed.\r\nThe lands are of prime agricultural quality.\r\nRoad frontage and site potential subject to planning.\r\nEir Code R95 KX20.  Situated in a lovely country setting, approximately 1mile off the main Kilkenny Castlecomer Road, 6 miles Castlecomer,7 miles Kilkenny city centre."
